The files of this directory come from autogluon/fev (https://github.com/autogluon/fev),
Apache-2.0, at commit 9cf943c388e5cfaf352175ea3c69e408b197d997:

- tasks.yaml          benchmarks/chronos_zeroshot/tasks.yaml (the 27 tasks of the Chronos
                      zero-shot benchmark, "Chronos-ZS")
- seasonal_naive.csv  benchmarks/chronos_zeroshot/results/seasonal_naive.csv (the seasonal-naive
                      reference every relative MASE and WQL divides by; fev 0.6.0)

They are copied unchanged. TinyCast (raws-labs/tinycast, Apache-2.0) vendors the same
seasonal_naive.csv byte for byte in evidence/chronos-zs/comparators/ and reports 0.8800 / 0.7218
relative MASE / WQL against it (evidence/chronos-zs/README.md).
